US EPA, Office of Water. Optimal Corrosion Control Treatment Evaluation Technical Recommendations for Primacy Agencies and Public Water Systems. EPA 816-B-16-003; March 2016, updated version hosted in 2019, 140 PDF pages. [Official PDF](https://www.epa.gov/sites/production/files/2019-07/documents/occtmarch2016updated.pdf) · [2019 updated text](https://nepis.epa.gov/Exe/ZyPURL.cgi?Dockey=P100X380.TXT).

Study chapter 2's material and water-quality interactions, chapter 3's treatment evaluation, chapter 5's start-up and monitoring, and chapter 6's source/treatment changes. Use Appendix C on investigative sampling and Appendix F on studies to critique an evidence plan. Read the regulatory sections as historical US context, not a current universal specification.

The cover, contents and introductory limitations were inspected on 30 October 2026. Public access and attribution are documented; retain separate credits and permissions. This guidance does not replace a materials inventory, site evidence or current requirements.
